title=About&slug=about&content=%3Ch2%3EAbout+Warpstorm%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWarpstorm+is+an+unofficial+Warhammer+40K+beginner+hub+and+an+original+dark+sci-fi+universe%2C+run+by+a+hobbyist+in+Denmark.+We+write+plain-English+guides+for+new+players+and+painters.+Not+affiliated+with+or+endorsed+by+Games+Workshop.%3C%2Fp%3E&status=publish